{"real": true, "dur": 199.56, "sent": [{"start": 0.14, "end": 3.72, "text": "Chinese has no articles and no verb conjugations.", "words": [{"w": "Chinese", "s": 0.14}, {"w": "has", "s": 0.72}, {"w": "no", "s": 1.0}, {"w": "articles", "s": 1.26}, {"w": "and", "s": 2.04}, {"w": "no", "s": 2.24}, {"w": "verb", "s": 2.54}, {"w": "conjugations.", "s": 2.84}]}, {"start": 4.46, "end": 10.24, "text": "Instead, what it does have is measure words, aspect markers and tones.", "words": [{"w": "Instead,", "s": 4.46}, {"w": "what", "s": 5.6}, {"w": "it", "s": 5.8}, {"w": "does", "s": 5.96}, {"w": "have", "s": 6.28}, {"w": "is", "s": 6.6}, {"w": "measure", "s": 6.84}, {"w": "words,", "s": 7.24}, {"w": "aspect", "s": 8.26}, {"w": "markers", "s": 8.66}, {"w": "and", "s": 9.58}, {"w": "tones.", "s": 9.8}]}, {"start": 11.12, "end": 15.54, "text": "But you can still use the same five categories for both languages.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 11.12}, {"w": "you", "s": 11.34}, {"w": "can", "s": 11.46}, {"w": "still", "s": 11.74}, {"w": "use", "s": 12.1}, {"w": "the", "s": 12.3}, {"w": "same", "s": 12.54}, {"w": "five", "s": 12.94}, {"w": "categories", "s": 13.26}, {"w": "for", "s": 14.32}, {"w": "both", "s": 14.56}, {"w": "languages.", "s": 14.88}]}, {"start": 16.059, "end": 19.76, "text": "In fact, I’d argue they work for any language.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 16.059}, {"w": "fact,", "s": 16.28}, {"w": "I’d", "s": 17.3}, {"w": "argue", "s": 17.64}, {"w": "they", "s": 18.18}, {"w": "work", "s": 18.46}, {"w": "for", "s": 18.74}, {"w": "any", "s": 19.02}, {"w": "language.", "s": 19.26}]}, {"start": 20.42, "end": 23.08, "text": "What changes is how important each one is.", "words": [{"w": "What", "s": 20.42}, {"w": "changes", "s": 20.64}, {"w": "is", "s": 21.28}, {"w": "how", "s": 21.48}, {"w": "important", "s": 21.72}, {"w": "each", "s": 22.3}, {"w": "one", "s": 22.54}, {"w": "is.", "s": 22.84}]}, {"start": 23.8, "end": 26.06, "text": "Let’s start with what the two languages share.", "words": [{"w": "Let’s", "s": 23.8}, {"w": "start", "s": 24.06}, {"w": "with", "s": 24.42}, {"w": "what", "s": 24.6}, {"w": "the", "s": 24.8}, {"w": "two", "s": 24.98}, {"w": "languages", "s": 25.2}, {"w": "share.", "s": 25.76}]}, {"start": 26.84, "end": 31.16, "text": "French and Mandarin overlap on vocabulary and sentence structure.", "words": [{"w": "French", "s": 26.84}, {"w": "and", "s": 27.5}, {"w": "Mandarin", "s": 27.7}, {"w": "overlap", "s": 28.36}, {"w": "on", "s": 28.9}, {"w": "vocabulary", "s": 29.1}, {"w": "and", "s": 30.0}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 30.28}, {"w": "structure.", "s": 30.72}]}, {"start": 31.58, "end": 34.06, "text": "Both use subject, verb, object.", "words": [{"w": "Both", "s": 31.58}, {"w": "use", "s": 31.96}, {"w": "subject,", "s": 32.34}, {"w": "verb,", "s": 33.24}, {"w": "object.", "s": 33.72}]}, {"start": 34.48, "end": 41.64, "text": "For example, look at these two sentences: “I go skiing” and “I drink coffee.” They’re built almost the same way.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 34.48}, {"w": "example,", "s": 34.58}, {"w": "look", "s": 35.62}, {"w": "at", "s": 35.78}, {"w": "these", "s": 35.9}, {"w": "two", "s": 36.16}, {"w": "sentences:", "s": 36.4}, {"w": "“I", "s": 37.02}, {"w": "go", "s": 37.68}, {"w": "skiing”", "s": 37.94}, {"w": "and", "s": 38.58}, {"w": "“I", "s": 38.7}, {"w": "drink", "s": 38.92}, {"w": "coffee.”", "s": 39.18}, {"w": "They’re", "s": 40.02}, {"w": "built", "s": 40.28}, {"w": "almost", "s": 40.66}, {"w": "the", "s": 41.06}, {"w": "same", "s": 41.22}, {"w": "way.", "s": 41.46}]}, {"start": 42.1, "end": 45.5, "text": "Beyond that, though, they divide the work differently.", "words": [{"w": "Beyond", "s": 42.1}, {"w": "that,", "s": 42.52}, {"w": "though,", "s": 42.84}, {"w": "they", "s": 43.78}, {"w": "divide", "s": 43.98}, {"w": "the", "s": 44.42}, {"w": "work", "s": 44.6}, {"w": "differently.", "s": 44.94}]}, {"start": 46.4, "end": 50.0, "text": "In French, word endings do a lot of the work.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 46.4}, {"w": "French,", "s": 46.6}, {"w": "word", "s": 47.56}, {"w": "endings", "s": 47.94}, {"w": "do", "s": 48.88}, {"w": "a", "s": 49.08}, {"w": "lot", "s": 49.2}, {"w": "of", "s": 49.44}, {"w": "the", "s": 49.6}, {"w": "work.", "s": 49.74}]}, {"start": 50.54, "end": 58.18, "text": "In Chinese, by contrast, sounds and vocabulary matter much more, and word order does a lot of the grammatical work.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 50.54}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 50.72}, {"w": "by", "s": 51.4}, {"w": "contrast,", "s": 51.58}, {"w": "sounds", "s": 52.52}, {"w": "and", "s": 52.94}, {"w": "vocabulary", "s": 53.14}, {"w": "matter", "s": 54.1}, {"w": "much", "s": 54.46}, {"w": "more,", "s": 54.78}, {"w": "and", "s": 55.44}, {"w": "word", "s": 55.66}, {"w": "order", "s": 55.98}, {"w": "does", "s": 56.52}, {"w": "a", "s": 56.72}, {"w": "lot", "s": 56.82}, {"w": "of", "s": 57.02}, {"w": "the", "s": 57.14}, {"w": "grammatical", "s": 57.26}, {"w": "work.", "s": 57.9}]}, {"start": 59.12, "end": 62.04, "text": "So let’s go through the five categories, one by one.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 59.12}, {"w": "let’s", "s": 59.28}, {"w": "go", "s": 59.56}, {"w": "through", "s": 59.78}, {"w": "the", "s": 60.0}, {"w": "five", "s": 60.16}, {"w": "categories,", "s": 60.46}, {"w": "one", "s": 61.38}, {"w": "by", "s": 61.58}, {"w": "one.", "s": 61.78}]}, {"start": 62.34, "end": 65.86, "text": "First, sounds, which carry a huge amount of weight.", "words": [{"w": "First,", "s": 62.34}, {"w": "sounds,", "s": 63.16}, {"w": "which", "s": 64.04}, {"w": "carry", "s": 64.34}, {"w": "a", "s": 64.66}, {"w": "huge", "s": 64.8}, {"w": "amount", "s": 65.16}, {"w": "of", "s": 65.459}, {"w": "weight.", "s": 65.58}]}, {"start": 66.64, "end": 72.8, "text": "Tones matter from the very first day, because if you get the tone wrong, you’ve said a different word.", "words": [{"w": "Tones", "s": 66.64}, {"w": "matter", "s": 67.3}, {"w": "from", "s": 67.64}, {"w": "the", "s": 67.82}, {"w": "very", "s": 67.96}, {"w": "first", "s": 68.26}, {"w": "day,", "s": 68.52}, {"w": "because", "s": 69.22}, {"w": "if", "s": 70.04}, {"w": "you", "s": 70.14}, {"w": "get", "s": 70.26}, {"w": "the", "s": 70.44}, {"w": "tone", "s": 70.6}, {"w": "wrong,", "s": 70.86}, {"w": "you’ve", "s": 71.64}, {"w": "said", "s": 71.86}, {"w": "a", "s": 72.1}, {"w": "different", "s": 72.2}, {"w": "word.", "s": 72.54}]}, {"start": 73.24, "end": 76.94, "text": "Look at this example: one syllable in four tones.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 73.24}, {"w": "at", "s": 73.42}, {"w": "this", "s": 73.54}, {"w": "example:", "s": 73.78}, {"w": "one", "s": 75.16}, {"w": "syllable", "s": 75.38}, {"w": "in", "s": 75.94}, {"w": "four", "s": 76.16}, {"w": "tones.", "s": 76.46}]}, {"start": 77.88, "end": 82.38, "text": "Mother, hemp, horse, scold.", "words": [{"w": "Mother,", "s": 77.88}, {"w": "hemp,", "s": 79.26}, {"w": "horse,", "s": 80.46}, {"w": "scold.", "s": 81.92}]}, {"start": 83.32, "end": 84.64, "text": "Four separate words.", "words": [{"w": "Four", "s": 83.32}, {"w": "separate", "s": 83.74}, {"w": "words.", "s": 84.18}]}, {"start": 85.18, "end": 92.84, "text": "So while in French a pronunciation mistake usually gets forgiven, in Chinese a tone mistake often won’t.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 85.18}, {"w": "while", "s": 85.4}, {"w": "in", "s": 85.7}, {"w": "French", "s": 85.94}, {"w": "a", "s": 86.56}, {"w": "pronunciation", "s": 86.68}, {"w": "mistake", "s": 87.52}, {"w": "usually", "s": 88.08}, {"w": "gets", "s": 88.44}, {"w": "forgiven,", "s": 88.68}, {"w": "in", "s": 90.14}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 90.32}, {"w": "a", "s": 91.12}, {"w": "tone", "s": 91.3}, {"w": "mistake", "s": 91.56}, {"w": "often", "s": 92.12}, {"w": "won’t.", "s": 92.48}]}, {"start": 93.7, "end": 97.56, "text": "Second, vocabulary, which is another big challenge.", "words": [{"w": "Second,", "s": 93.7}, {"w": "vocabulary,", "s": 94.62}, {"w": "which", "s": 96.06}, {"w": "is", "s": 96.28}, {"w": "another", "s": 96.44}, {"w": "big", "s": 96.84}, {"w": "challenge.", "s": 97.06}]}, {"start": 98.0, "end": 101.98, "text": "For one thing, there are almost no cognates to help you.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 98.0}, {"w": "one", "s": 98.2}, {"w": "thing,", "s": 98.42}, {"w": "there", "s": 99.1}, {"w": "are", "s": 99.32}, {"w": "almost", "s": 99.54}, {"w": "no", "s": 100.2}, {"w": "cognates", "s": 100.48}, {"w": "to", "s": 101.4}, {"w": "help", "s": 101.54}, {"w": "you.", "s": 101.84}]}, {"start": 102.66, "end": 110.68, "text": "And because of the characters, every word has to be learned twice: once by ear and once in writing.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 102.66}, {"w": "because", "s": 102.8}, {"w": "of", "s": 103.26}, {"w": "the", "s": 103.4}, {"w": "characters,", "s": 103.56}, {"w": "every", "s": 104.94}, {"w": "word", "s": 105.26}, {"w": "has", "s": 105.88}, {"w": "to", "s": 106.1}, {"w": "be", "s": 106.22}, {"w": "learned", "s": 106.38}, {"w": "twice:", "s": 106.76}, {"w": "once", "s": 108.08}, {"w": "by", "s": 108.4}, {"w": "ear", "s": 108.68}, {"w": "and", "s": 109.36}, {"w": "once", "s": 109.6}, {"w": "in", "s": 110.06}, {"w": "writing.", "s": 110.18}]}, {"start": 111.1, "end": 114.82, "text": "Third, word forms, on the other hand, are much simpler.", "words": [{"w": "Third,", "s": 111.1}, {"w": "word", "s": 111.92}, {"w": "forms,", "s": 112.18}, {"w": "on", "s": 112.86}, {"w": "the", "s": 112.96}, {"w": "other", "s": 113.1}, {"w": "hand,", "s": 113.32}, {"w": "are", "s": 113.92}, {"w": "much", "s": 114.1}, {"w": "simpler.", "s": 114.42}]}, {"start": 115.58, "end": 123.4, "text": "For example, aspect particles do some of the work that tense endings do in French, without the conjugation tables.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 115.58}, {"w": "example,", "s": 115.74}, {"w": "aspect", "s": 116.76}, {"w": "particles", "s": 117.18}, {"w": "do", "s": 117.84}, {"w": "some", "s": 118.08}, {"w": "of", "s": 118.32}, {"w": "the", "s": 118.44}, {"w": "work", "s": 118.58}, {"w": "that", "s": 119.2}, {"w": "tense", "s": 119.44}, {"w": "endings", "s": 119.86}, {"w": "do", "s": 120.3}, {"w": "in", "s": 120.5}, {"w": "French,", "s": 120.72}, {"w": "without", "s": 121.62}, {"w": "the", "s": 122.04}, {"w": "conjugation", "s": 122.2}, {"w": "tables.", "s": 122.92}]}, {"start": 123.86, "end": 128.96, "text": "Fourth, sentence structure, by contrast, matters enormously.", "words": [{"w": "Fourth,", "s": 123.86}, {"w": "sentence", "s": 124.86}, {"w": "structure,", "s": 125.28}, {"w": "by", "s": 126.28}, {"w": "contrast,", "s": 126.5}, {"w": "matters", "s": 127.6}, {"w": "enormously.", "s": 128.259}]}, {"start": 129.759, "end": 137.3, "text": "Because Chinese has little inflection, grammar relies on word order, topic and comment, and particles.", "words": [{"w": "Because", "s": 129.759}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 130.58}, {"w": "has", "s": 131.02}, {"w": "little", "s": 131.28}, {"w": "inflection,", "s": 131.58}, {"w": "grammar", "s": 132.7}, {"w": "relies", "s": 133.12}, {"w": "on", "s": 133.6}, {"w": "word", "s": 133.8}, {"w": "order,", "s": 134.08}, {"w": "topic", "s": 134.8}, {"w": "and", "s": 135.28}, {"w": "comment,", "s": 135.46}, {"w": "and", "s": 136.44}, {"w": "particles.", "s": 136.66}]}, {"start": 137.8, "end": 139.34, "text": "Look at the pair of sentences here.", "words": [{"w": "Look", "s": 137.8}, {"w": "at", "s": 137.96}, {"w": "the", "s": 138.08}, {"w": "pair", "s": 138.2}, {"w": "of", "s": 138.4}, {"w": "sentences", "s": 138.54}, {"w": "here.", "s": 139.14}]}, {"start": 139.76, "end": 140.98, "text": "It’s a classic example.", "words": [{"w": "It’s", "s": 139.76}, {"w": "a", "s": 139.92}, {"w": "classic", "s": 140.04}, {"w": "example.", "s": 140.46}]}, {"start": 141.52, "end": 142.98, "text": "And here’s something interesting.", "words": [{"w": "And", "s": 141.52}, {"w": "here’s", "s": 141.7}, {"w": "something", "s": 142.04}, {"w": "interesting.", "s": 142.44}]}, {"start": 143.7, "end": 147.52, "text": "Measure words give Chinese its own kind of agreement.", "words": [{"w": "Measure", "s": 143.7}, {"w": "words", "s": 144.24}, {"w": "give", "s": 144.86}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 145.12}, {"w": "its", "s": 145.8}, {"w": "own", "s": 146.06}, {"w": "kind", "s": 146.34}, {"w": "of", "s": 146.68}, {"w": "agreement.", "s": 146.9}]}, {"start": 148.04, "end": 154.3, "text": "In French, every noun has a gender, and the article and adjective have to match it.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 148.04}, {"w": "French,", "s": 148.28}, {"w": "every", "s": 149.18}, {"w": "noun", "s": 149.5}, {"w": "has", "s": 149.92}, {"w": "a", "s": 150.12}, {"w": "gender,", "s": 150.26}, {"w": "and", "s": 151.3}, {"w": "the", "s": 151.44}, {"w": "article", "s": 151.62}, {"w": "and", "s": 152.34}, {"w": "adjective", "s": 152.58}, {"w": "have", "s": 153.42}, {"w": "to", "s": 153.62}, {"w": "match", "s": 153.78}, {"w": "it.", "s": 154.1}]}, {"start": 155.42, "end": 160.28, "text": "In Chinese, in the same way, every noun has its own classifier.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 155.42}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 155.6}, {"w": "in", "s": 156.66}, {"w": "the", "s": 156.76}, {"w": "same", "s": 156.92}, {"w": "way,", "s": 157.2}, {"w": "every", "s": 157.96}, {"w": "noun", "s": 158.26}, {"w": "has", "s": 158.78}, {"w": "its", "s": 158.96}, {"w": "own", "s": 159.24}, {"w": "classifier.", "s": 159.54}]}, {"start": 160.74, "end": 166.08, "text": "Here you’ve got a photo, a bottle and a room, and each takes a different one.", "words": [{"w": "Here", "s": 160.74}, {"w": "you’ve", "s": 161.1}, {"w": "got", "s": 161.34}, {"w": "a", "s": 161.56}, {"w": "photo,", "s": 161.7}, {"w": "a", "s": 162.68}, {"w": "bottle", "s": 162.82}, {"w": "and", "s": 163.48}, {"w": "a", "s": 163.66}, {"w": "room,", "s": 163.76}, {"w": "and", "s": 164.42}, {"w": "each", "s": 164.66}, {"w": "takes", "s": 165.0}, {"w": "a", "s": 165.34}, {"w": "different", "s": 165.44}, {"w": "one.", "s": 165.86}]}, {"start": 166.92, "end": 170.76, "text": "So you basically have to learn the classifier along with the noun.", "words": [{"w": "So", "s": 166.92}, {"w": "you", "s": 167.2}, {"w": "basically", "s": 167.36}, {"w": "have", "s": 167.92}, {"w": "to", "s": 168.12}, {"w": "learn", "s": 168.28}, {"w": "the", "s": 168.5}, {"w": "classifier", "s": 168.64}, {"w": "along", "s": 169.76}, {"w": "with", "s": 170.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 170.28}, {"w": "noun.", "s": 170.44}]}, {"start": 171.76, "end": 174.42, "text": "In short, Chinese has plenty of grammar.", "words": [{"w": "In", "s": 171.76}, {"w": "short,", "s": 171.96}, {"w": "Chinese", "s": 172.68}, {"w": "has", "s": 173.12}, {"w": "plenty", "s": 173.4}, {"w": "of", "s": 173.84}, {"w": "grammar.", "s": 174.02}]}, {"start": 174.92, "end": 179.96, "text": "It’s just moved out of the word endings and into the vocabulary and the sentence.", "words": [{"w": "It’s", "s": 174.92}, {"w": "just", "s": 175.18}, {"w": "moved", "s": 175.54}, {"w": "out", "s": 175.92}, {"w": "of", "s": 176.14}, {"w": "the", "s": 176.28}, {"w": "word", "s": 176.44}, {"w": "endings", "s": 176.78}, {"w": "and", "s": 177.42}, {"w": "into", "s": 177.68}, {"w": "the", "s": 178.04}, {"w": "vocabulary", "s": 178.2}, {"w": "and", "s": 179.08}, {"w": "the", "s": 179.22}, {"w": "sentence.", "s": 179.38}]}, {"start": 180.7, "end": 184.66, "text": "Fifth and last, writing is a different story altogether.", "words": [{"w": "Fifth", "s": 180.7}, {"w": "and", "s": 181.1}, {"w": "last,", "s": 181.32}, {"w": "writing", "s": 182.14}, {"w": "is", "s": 182.7}, {"w": "a", "s": 182.88}, {"w": "different", "s": 183.02}, {"w": "story", "s": 183.44}, {"w": "altogether.", "s": 184.0}]}, {"start": 185.36, "end": 188.32, "text": "For Chinese, it’s a whole track of its own.", "words": [{"w": "For", "s": 185.36}, {"w": "Chinese,", "s": 185.56}, {"w": "it’s", "s": 186.52}, {"w": "a", "s": 186.74}, {"w": "whole", "s": 186.92}, {"w": "track", "s": 187.26}, {"w": "of", "s": 187.62}, {"w": "its", "s": 187.8}, {"w": "own.", "s": 188.08}]}, {"start": 188.68, "end": 198.9, "text": "But some languages, including many Indigenous languages, are learned mostly by listening, so they have few script goals, or none.", "words": [{"w": "But", "s": 188.68}, {"w": "some", "s": 189.32}, {"w": "languages,", "s": 189.56}, {"w": "including", "s": 190.6}, {"w": "many", "s": 191.34}, {"w": "Indigenous", "s": 191.68}, {"w": "languages,", "s": 192.28}, {"w": "are", "s": 193.44}, {"w": "learned", "s": 193.64}, {"w": "mostly", "s": 194.18}, {"w": "by", "s": 194.64}, {"w": "listening,", "s": 194.82}, {"w": "so", "s": 196.06}, {"w": "they", "s": 196.32}, {"w": "have", "s": 196.46}, {"w": "few", "s": 196.7}, {"w": "script", "s": 196.94}, {"w": "goals,", "s": 197.24}, {"w": "or", "s": 198.16}, {"w": "none.", "s": 198.58}]}]}